;C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\;C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\System32\\\\OpenSSH\\\\;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\nodejs\\\\;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Git\\\\cmd;C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\ComposerSetup\\\\bin;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Android\\\\Android Studio\\\\jre\\\\bin;C:\\\\Users\\\\abelg\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps;C:\\\\Users\\\\abelg\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\GitHubDesktop\\\\bin;C:\\\\Users\\\\abelg\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\npm;C:\\\\Users\\\\abelg\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Programs\\\\Microsoft VS Code\\\\bin;C:\\\\laragon\\\\bin\\\\php\\\\php-7.4.19-Win32-vc15-x64;C:\\\\Users\\\\abelg\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\Composer\\\\vendor\\\\bin;C:\\\\Users\\\\abelg\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Android\\\\Sdk\\\\platform-tools\",\"SystemRoot\":\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\",\"COMSPEC\":\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\system32\\\\cmd.exe\",\"PATHEXT\":\".COM;.EXE;.BAT;.CMD;.VBS;.VBE;.JS;.JSE;.WSF;.WSH;.MSC\",\"WINDIR\":\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\",\"SERVER_SIGNATURE\":\"\",\"SERVER_SOFTWARE\":\"Apache\\/2.4.47 (Win64) OpenSSL\\/1.1.1k PHP\\/7.4.19\",\"SERVER_NAME\":\"farmac.local\",\"SERVER_ADDR\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"SERVER_PORT\":\"80\",\"REMOTE_ADDR\":\"127.0.0.1\",\"DOCUMENT_ROOT\":\"C:\\/laragon\\/www\\/farmac\\/web\",\"REQUEST_SCHEME\":\"http\",\"CONTEXT_PREFIX\":\"\",\"CONTEXT_DOCUMENT_ROOT\":\"C:\\/laragon\\/www\\/farmac\\/web\",\"SERVER_ADMIN\":\"admin@example.com\",\"SCRIPT_FILENAME\":\"C:\\/laragon\\/www\\/farmac\\/web\\/index.php\",\"REMOTE_PORT\":\"52368\",\"REDIRECT_URL\":\"\\/file\\/upload\",\"GATEWAY_INTERFACE\":\"CGI\\/1.1\",\"SERVER_PROTOCOL\":\"HTTP\\/1.1\",\"REQUEST_METHOD\":\"POST\",\"QUERY_STRING\":\"\",\"REQUEST_URI\":\"\\/file\\/upload\",\"SCRIPT_NAME\":\"\\/index.php\",\"PHP_SELF\":\"\\/index.php\",\"REQUEST_TIME_FLOAT\":1672149400.596737,\"REQUEST_TIME\":1672149400}', 1, 3, 3, '2022-12-27 05:56:41', '2022-12-27 05:56:41'),
(26, 3, 1, '{\"_csrf\":\"VWobKewgtSo8SDzSt3TgovfyChJPoxJQgJ29Iwc4FKsvP14YghHMf10uWbuPLq_nxoVpen_6RjLN6flGUnAgww==\",\"Article\":{\"category\":\"Poultry\",\"menu\":\"Chicken\",\"title\":\"Paraan ng Pagpaparami ng Manok\",\"photo\":\"Rs1CfkGyp2-1672149401\",\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\r\\n<h3>Layunin ng Pagaaral<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>1. Mapataas ang produksyon ng paghahayupan at pagmamanukan upang mapanatili ang pinagkukunan nito sa lahat ng oras (availability), makita at mabili sa mas maraming lugar (accessibility) sa murang presyo ng mga produkto nito.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>2. Buhayin ang ekonomiya sa kabukiran sa pamamagitan ng pagtataguyod ng hanapbuhay at taasan ang kita ng magsasaka.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>3. Pagtitiyak na naaayon ang mga gawaing nakasanayan sa pag- aalaga ng mga hayop na ayon sa pangangalaga ng kapaligiran.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p><br \\/><br \\/><br \\/><br \\/><\\/p>\\r\\n<hr \\/>\\r\\n<h3 id=\\\"Introduction\\\">Panimula<\\/h3>\\r\\n<dl>\\r\\n<dd>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Maraming pamilyang Pinoy ang nag-aalaga ng manok na natural at karaniwang ito ay matatagpuan sa bakuran nila. Ang pag-aalaga ng mga ito ay isang malaking bahagi ng pagsasaka dahil ito ay pangunahing pinagkukunan ng itlog, karne at nakakatulong bilang dagdag-kita sa mga pamilyang nag-aalaga nito. Ang karne ng manok na ito ay may naiibang lasa, amoy at tekstura at pinaniniwalaang may malaking tulong sa kalusugan. Mahal ang presyo ng itlog at karne nito dahil ito ay karaniwang inaalagaan sa natural na paraan. Ang industriya ng natural na pagmamanukan ay nahaharap sa pagsubok dahil sa pagpasok at paglago ng makabagong lahi ng manok. Ngunit ito ay unti-unting sumisibol at lumalago sa napakaraming dahilan. Isa na rito ang paghahanap ng mga mamimili ng natural na pagkain.<\\/dd>\\r\\n<dd>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Malaki ang potensyal ng natural na manok na lumago sapagkat ito ay sanay na sa uri ng panahon sa Pilipinas; kumakain ng mga lokal na pagkain, mga farm wastes at hindi nangangailangan ng masusing pangangalaga. May dalawang uri ang manok na natural--- Pagala (Free-Range) at nakakulong. Ang babasahing ito ay naglalaman ng Teknolohiya na gamit ay sampung-inahin-at-dalawang-tandang (10-hen-and-2-rooster) sa pagpapadami ng natural na manok.<\\/dd>\\r\\n<\\/dl>\"},\"search\":\"\",\"file\":\"Paraan ng Pagpaparami ng Manok.jpg\"}', '{\"slug\":null,\"record_status\":null,\"category\":null,\"menu\":null,\"title\":null,\"photo\":null,\"content\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":null,\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":null,\"id\":null}', 'POST', 'http://farmac.local/article/create', 'create', 'article', 'articles', 'Article', '127.0.0.1', 'Chrome', 'Windows', 'Computer', '{\"REDIRECT_STATUS\":\"200\",\"HTTP_HOST\":\"farmac.local\",\"HTTP_CONNECTION\":\"keep-alive\",\"CONTENT_LENGTH\":\"2504\",\"HTTP_CACHE_CONTROL\":\"max-age=0\",\"HTTP_UPGRADE_INSECURE_REQUESTS\":\"1\",\"HTTP_ORIGIN\":\"http:\\/\\/farmac.local\",\"CONTENT_TYPE\":\"application\\/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\"HTTP_USER_AGENT\":\"Mozilla\\/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit\\/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome\\/108.0.0.0 Safari\\/537.36\",\"HTTP_ACCEPT\":\"text\\/html,application\\/xhtml+xml,application\\/xml;q=0.9,image\\/avif,image\\/webp,image\\/apng,*\\/*;q=0.8,application\\/signed-exchange;v=b3;q=0.9\",\"HTTP_REFERER\":\"http:\\/\\/farmac.local\\/article\\/create\",\"HTTP_ACCEPT_ENCODING\":\"gzip, deflate\",\"HTTP_ACCEPT_LANGUAGE\":\"en-US,en;q=0.9\",\"HTTP_COOKIE\":\"PHPSESSID=4cgjcf8rcqb43f25msq1gu4spk; _csrf=0407510eac07b15a2e90353ab6c6d9ccc6ebf271b36ac62dfd4e13c3c80c150ca%3A2%3A%7Bi%3A0%3Bs%3A5%3A%22_csrf%22%3Bi%3A1%3Bs%3A32%3A%22zUE1n1yUafei8ZOE1wch0YTbMtDeUH4h%22%3B%7D\",\"PATH\":\"C:\\\\Windows\\\\system32;C:\\\\Windows;C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\Wbem;C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\;C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\OpenSSH\\\\;C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\NVIDIA Corporation\\\\PhysX\\\\Common;C:\\\\Program Files\\\\NVIDIA Corp