alo ang mga ito bilang pakain.<\\/div>\\r\\n<br \\/><br \\/><br \\/><br \\/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ang inahin ay kumakain ng 50 grams ng patuka araw-araw o maaaring kumain ng mga forages at iba pang farms wastes o mga by<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>-products. Ang mga hinating kawayan o lumang gulong ay maaaring gawing lalagyan ng patuka o tubig. Maglagay ng malinis na tubig sa lahat ng oras.<\\/p>\",\"sort\":0,\"slug\":\"mga-pagkain-at-paraan-ng-pagpapakain\",\"record_status\":1,\"created_by\":3,\"updated_by\":3,\"created_at\":\"2022-12-27 14:19:10\",\"updated_at\":\"2022-12-27 14:19:10\"}}', 'POST', 'http://farmac.local/article/create/paraan-ng-pagpaparami-ng-manok?step=sort', 'create', 'article', 'articles', 'Article', '127.0.0.1', 'Chrome', 'Windows', 'Computer', '{\"REDIRECT_STATUS\":\"200\",\"HTTP_HOST\":\"farmac.local\",\"HTTP_CONNECTION\":\"keep-alive\",\"CONTENT_LENGTH\":\"245\",\"HTTP_CACHE_CONTROL\":\"max-age=0\",\"HTTP_UPGRADE_INSECURE_REQUESTS\":\"1\",\"HTTP_ORIGIN\":\"http:\\/\\/farmac.local\",\"CONTENT_TYPE\":\"application\\/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\"HTTP_USER_AGENT\":\"Mozilla\\/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit\\/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome\\/108.0.0.0 Safari\\/537.36\",\"HTTP_ACCEPT\":\"text\\/html,application\\/xhtml+xml,application\\/xml;q=0.9,image\\/avif,image\\/webp,image\\/apng,*\\/*;q=0.8,application\\/signed-exchange;v=b3;q=0.9\",\"HTTP_REFERER\":\"http:\\/\\/farmac.local\\/article\\/create\\/paraan-ng-pagpaparami-ng-manok?step=sort\",\"HTTP_ACCEPT_ENCODING\":\"gzip, deflate\",\"HTTP_ACCEPT_LANGUAGE\":\"en-US,en;q=0.9\",\"HTTP_COOKIE\":\"PHPSESSID=4cgjcf8rcqb43f25msq1gu4spk; _csrf=0407510eac07b15a2e90353ab6c6d9ccc6ebf271b36ac62dfd4e13c3c80c150ca%3A2%3A%7Bi%3A0%3Bs%3A5%3A%22_csrf%22%3Bi%3A1%3Bs%3A32%3A%22zUE1n1yUafei8ZOE1wch0YTbMtDeUH4h%22%3B%7D\",\"PATH\":\"C:\\\\Windows\\\\system32;C:\\\\Windows;C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\Wbem;C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\;C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\OpenSSH\\\\;C:\\\\